# Stray per-app package-lock.json files broke older server deploys (AIRAVATA-2951).
# The npm-workspaces setup keeps a single ROOT lockfile, which must be committed so
# `npm ci` works in CI and the Docker build; ignore only nested lockfiles.
**/package-lock.json
